"多个 IP 用空格隔开，IPv4 和 IPv6 都可以，最多 20 个。手机可能时而用 IPv4、时而用 IPv6，换网络后 IP 也会变——以后交易页提示 IP 不在白名单时，把它显示的新 IP 补进来即可。" = "Separate several IPs with spaces — IPv4 and IPv6 both work, up to 20. A phone may connect over IPv4 at one moment and IPv6 the next, and a new network means a new IP — whenever the Trade tab says your IP isn't on the list, just add the new one it shows.";
"保存 API Key 和 Secret" = "Save the API Key and Secret";
"输入谷歌验证码确认后，页面会显示 API Key 和 API Secret。Secret 只显示这一次，请立刻复制。" = "After you confirm with your Google Authenticator code, the page shows the API Key and API Secret. The Secret is shown only once — copy it right away.";
"填进 App" = "Add it to the app";
"回到「设置 → 交易（SafeTrade）」，粘贴 API Key 和 API Secret 并保存，App 会马上验证能否使用。" = "Go to Settings → Trade (SafeTrade), paste the API Key and API Secret and save; the app checks right away that they work.";
"获取 API 密钥" = "Get an API key";
"暂时查不到当前 IP，请稍后再试。" = "Can't look up your current IP right now. Please try again later.";
"安全说明" = "Security";
"API Key 和 Secret 只存在你的钥匙串里（iCloud 钥匙串，端到端加密），不会上传到我们的服务器。" = "Your API Key and Secret are stored only in your Keychain (iCloud Keychain, end-to-end encrypted) and are never uploaded to our servers.";
"App 直接连接 safetrade.com，中间不经过我们或任何第三方。Secret 只在你的设备上用来给请求签名，本身从不发送出去。" = "The app talks to safetrade.com directly — nothing passes through us or any third party. The Secret is used only on your device to sign requests and is never sent anywhere itself.";
"每次提现前都要通过设备验证（Face ID、Touch ID 或密码）。" = "Every withdrawal needs device authentication first (Face ID, Touch ID or your passcode).";
"Pearl Hub 的源代码公开在 GitHub，任何人都可以检查。" = "Pearl Hub's source code is public on GitHub for anyone to check.";
"查看源代码" = "View the source code";
"建议只开需要的权限，并绑定 IP。不要把 API Key 或 Secret 告诉任何人，包括自称客服的人。" = "Only turn on the permissions you need, and bind IPs. Never share your API Key or Secret with anyone — including people claiming to be support.";
"如何获取 API 密钥" = "How to get an API key";
